From 971cf6cf6fc158fe80a476b76c755a581215eb60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lattice PQ <pq@lattice.local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:03:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] lattice: add agave-mldsa-verify crate (ML-DSA-65 via
 fips204 =0.4.6)

Deterministic FIPS 204 ML-DSA-65 verification (pure, empty context) with
explicit version, length and message-size checks, a compute-unit cost
calibrated against secp256k1_recover, NIST ACVP sigVer known-answer tests
and cross-implementation vectors from @noble/post-quantum 0.7.1.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
